      "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into lipe/sail\n\n* origin/main: (100 commits)\n  Add EPC, uepc, ucause, and related spell check words\n  Update ace-ISA-unpriv.adoc\n  Update ace-ISA-unpriv.adoc\n  Update ace-ISA-unpriv.adoc\n  Update ace-ISA-unpriv.adoc\n  Refactor ACE error codes and split unconf/unimpl errors\n  Update ace-ISA-unpriv.adoc\n  Fix formatting of KeyType field description Shortened discussion of Horizontal trapping.\n  Update ace-ISA-unpriv.adoc\n  Add `unpriv` to cspell, update docs-resources submodule, and various doc improvements\n  Fix table column alignment in error code table\n  Bump version to 0.3.3\n  Fix ECC states. Remove transient states and rely only on progress field.\n  Update ace-ISA-unpriv.adoc\n  Fix minor doc and config formatting issues\n  Update ace-ISA-unpriv.adoc\n  Move `acemarchid` to unpriv section and misc doc fixes\n  Add HasSecondPoint, OutputType, and SecondPoint internal state\n  Update ace-ISA-unpriv.adoc\n  Bump version to v0.3.2\n  ...",
